 trip is a balance between greed and survival. Push too far, and you may not make it back.\n\nWith tense exploration, simple mechanics, and an ever-present threat, Crystal Game turns crystal hunting into a high-risk adventure where every decision matters.", "short_description": "Crystal Game is a cave-exploration adventure where you play as a monkey collecting glowing crystals to sell for profit \u2014 all while something dangerous lurks deep in the tunnels."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/crystal-game/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shiva", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/crystal-game/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "25539757258987128"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1946825379600883"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1946825379600883"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1768942080, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1946825379600883"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25815348784761306", "version": "11"}, "id": "1205234031579052", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [